WEBVTT

00:02:02.756 --> 00:02:05.248
Who bit you?

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.641
My old lady...

00:02:11.665 --> 00:02:15.192
| hugged her... and she bit me.

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:24.410
I'love her so much and missed her
so much and then... chomp.

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:29.626
Hilarious, isn't it?

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:33.587
I wish I had never been born...

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:37.100
I'm jealous of you...

00:02:37.124 --> 00:02:40.992
What did you just say? You're jealous?!

00:02:42.029 --> 00:02:45.795
My mother... passed away...

00:02:47.668 --> 00:02:52.315
Cancer. And she was only 35...

00:02:52.339 --> 00:02:55.365
She grew THIS thin...

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:01.958
You would have thought she was 90...

00:03:01.982 --> 00:03:04.327
She slept for 5 years straight...

00:03:04.351 --> 00:03:07.063
I can't even hug her...

00:03:07.087 --> 00:03:12.082
Even if I could have her bite me,
her teeth fell out long ago...

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:47.918
You got to win today.
You still have a chance.

00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:06.612
"Challenge!"

00:04:39.813 --> 00:04:42.748
Yuri Chakovsky-sama?

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:56.686
Something's come up, Nina.
Our flight is off.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:10.535
It's finally happening...!

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:25.157
At 2400 hours, huh...

00:05:54.321 --> 00:05:59.735
Madam. I've notified
everyone about tonight.

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:02.538
--Kuriyagawa...
--Yes?

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:07.743
He told me I'm nothing but leftovers...

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:11.848
I'm at a loss for words...

00:06:11.872 --> 00:06:18.421
Tonight, he and my greatest masterpiece,
Baki, will fight.

00:06:18.445 --> 00:06:21.457
--Do you think he can win?
-Well...

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:27.029
I'm sure that in a blink of an eye
that beast of a man

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:31.033
will send my masterpiece to his grave...

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:33.035
Madam...

00:06:33.059 --> 00:06:40.989
Not to mention all the years
| sacrificed my fate to...

00:06:42.002 --> 00:06:45.848
Madam! I'm sure Master Baki will win!

00:06:45.872 --> 00:06:51.436
After all, in his eyes,
this match is for his mother's--

00:06:53.179 --> 00:06:55.725
Shut up!

00:06:55.749 --> 00:06:57.260
Madam...!

00:06:57.284 --> 00:07:00.396
In Baki's eyes? For his mother?

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:03.014
Quit spewing crap!

00:07:06.593 --> 00:07:10.689
He had some nerve to do that...!

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:24.020
I'll use anything I have to!

00:07:24.044 --> 00:07:28.424
Even my own child!
That's how crazy I am for him!

00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:33.863
A mother-son bond? Ha! Get real!
Who cares about that?!

00:07:33.887 --> 00:07:37.233
Hanma Yujiro is the
world's greatest man!

00:07:37.257 --> 00:07:40.436
Everything is meaningless before him!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.439
What's going to happen tonight...?!

00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:48.144
That's enough. Any more and
you'll just exhaust yourself.

00:07:48.168 --> 00:07:51.380
No! I have to start warming up now!

00:07:51.404 --> 00:07:54.650
You've been at it for 3 hours.

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:57.386
You going to keep going until midnight?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:02.191
Yeah, I'm gonna spend 12 hours
heating myself up, including my shoes!

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:07.563
I'm pretty sure his low-gear
isn't below my top-gear.

00:08:07.587 --> 00:08:09.732
Still...

00:08:09.756 --> 00:08:12.268
Heya!

00:08:12.292 --> 00:08:14.727
| brought 'em, Baki!

00:08:16.229 --> 00:08:18.561
That was fast, Kitazawa-san!

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:24.213
Looks like they'll fit the bill!

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:29.539
Yeah! Each one's as strong as 20 punks!

00:08:32.679 --> 00:08:36.092
What're you whisperin' about?!

00:08:36.116 --> 00:08:39.895
--Well, Kitazawa?!
--Sorry! Sorry!

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:44.015
So where's this punk
who wants ta fight us?!

00:08:45.859 --> 00:08:50.139
Hi! I'm Baki! Nice to meet ya!

00:08:50.163 --> 00:08:52.241
"Nice to meet ya?!"

00:08:52.265 --> 00:08:56.512
--We're fightin' this tyke?!
--You screwin' with us?!

00:08:56.536 --> 00:09:00.182
You got a death wish or something?!

00:09:00.206 --> 00:09:01.851
Wait a sec...!

00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:04.606
<i>--Oh, no, you don't!
--Get back here!</i>

00:09:05.912 --> 00:09:09.558
--Get the hell back here!
--Damn kid!

00:09:09.582 --> 00:09:11.676
Sorry! Had to get this!

00:09:15.522 --> 00:09:19.402
Don't tell me you're
gonna fight with that on?

00:09:19.426 --> 00:09:22.885
Don't worry. It's not for me.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.394
Then who's it for, runt?!

00:09:32.105 --> 00:09:36.085
These guys wouldn't even
serve as morning warm-ups.

00:09:36.109 --> 00:09:38.521
It's Hanayama-san...!

00:09:38.545 --> 00:09:40.411
Hanayama-san!

00:09:43.883 --> 00:09:45.895
You're early, Hanayama-san!

00:09:45.919 --> 00:09:48.164
You seem in high spirits.

00:09:48.188 --> 00:09:49.815
Yuri-san!

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:55.538
Why's the master brawler Hanayama
and the welterweight champ--

00:09:55.562 --> 00:09:59.575
They aren't worth your time.
Shall I take you on?

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:04.180
--No, I couldn't ask that...!
--Then allow me.

00:10:04.204 --> 00:10:09.185
| don't doubt your skill,
but this ain't boxing.

00:10:09.209 --> 00:10:11.387
Have you ever been in a real fight?

00:10:11.411 --> 00:10:15.224
I've fought 207 boxing matches
from the amateurs to the pros,

00:10:15.248 --> 00:10:19.728
but I've had more than twice as many
real fights. In Russia, of course.

00:10:19.752 --> 00:10:24.383
Incidentally, I consider our
last fight as a boxing match.

00:10:26.126 --> 00:10:28.595
Um...

00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:36.545
| apologize for my poor manners.

00:10:36.569 --> 00:10:38.628
You do it.

00:10:42.575 --> 00:10:47.513
I'll take you up on your offer, then!

00:10:55.922 --> 00:10:58.434
Yokota Base was a good idea.

00:10:58.458 --> 00:11:03.639
The police don't have authority here
so they can go all-out crazy.

00:11:03.663 --> 00:11:08.533
- I hope ol' Nomura makes it in time...
--Gaia would never be late.

00:11:09.169 --> 00:11:12.848
--An urgent mission?
--Sorry, but go on ahead.

00:11:12.872 --> 00:11:16.552
No, that's fine, but why just you?

00:11:16.576 --> 00:11:18.654
Not me. Gaia.

00:11:18.678 --> 00:11:19.522
Gaia?

00:11:19.546 --> 00:11:23.779
Yeah. Only he can do this mission...

00:12:22.775 --> 00:12:26.589
Ogre. I hear you tore up
the Prime Minister's place.

00:12:26.613 --> 00:12:30.659
I'll fix that conceited nature of yours!

00:12:30.683 --> 00:12:33.329
I hear YOU lost to Baki.

00:12:33.353 --> 00:12:36.632
A maggot like you can't
even handle a toddler.

00:12:36.656 --> 00:12:40.636
I merely respected him as a fighter.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:44.974
He achieved victory by suppressing
his indispensable bloodlust.

00:12:44.998 --> 00:12:48.764
He was a much greater warrior
than his father.

00:12:49.602 --> 00:12:52.281
| have yet to face you,

00:12:52.305 --> 00:12:58.220
but I despise amateurs like you
who claim to be the world's strongest!

00:12:58.244 --> 00:13:04.445
I'll smash that flashy armor right now
until there's nothing left!

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:30.486
I can't see a thing...!

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.501
I'm not hitting him...!

00:13:37.183 --> 00:13:38.827
A kick...?!

00:13:38.851 --> 00:13:41.115
Yuri kicked him!

00:13:47.527 --> 00:13:49.017
It's over!

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.652
Um... I can see all your punches.

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:04.887
What?!

00:14:04.911 --> 00:14:06.021
As I thought.

00:14:06.045 --> 00:14:11.327
What just happened?! Why didn't
that punch send him flying?!

00:14:11.351 --> 00:14:14.897
It didn't hit him. It just grazed him.

00:14:14.921 --> 00:14:19.702
The instant he was hit, Baki turned
his head faster than the punch

00:14:19.726 --> 00:14:22.371
to deflect the damage.

00:14:22.395 --> 00:14:24.261
That's crazy...!

00:14:27.066 --> 00:14:28.727
Yuri-san...

00:14:29.602 --> 00:14:30.967
Sorry!

00:14:43.149 --> 00:14:45.174
| guess I'm up.

00:14:48.921 --> 00:14:51.066
Hanayama Kaoru's brawling...!

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:54.670
| can't possibly act as
Hanma Yujiro's replacement,

00:14:54.694 --> 00:14:59.860
but this IS a real fight,
so I'll have to make it as such.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:09.885
Whoa!

00:15:09.909 --> 00:15:13.345
Sorry, I didn't mean to dodge...!

00:15:16.883 --> 00:15:19.909
Is he intending to take that blow...?!

00:15:22.655 --> 00:15:23.816
Bring it on!

00:15:35.501 --> 00:15:39.802
--Stop! He'll die!
--No. Look.

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:43.708
He's smiling...!

00:15:49.782 --> 00:15:51.841
Are you all right?!

00:15:53.553 --> 00:15:57.566
Hanayama-san. He appears
to be far beyond us now.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:00.423
Let us do this slowly and surely.

00:16:05.565 --> 00:16:09.445
| apologize for making you
come all the way out like this.

00:16:09.469 --> 00:16:13.133
Not at all.
Strydom filled me in on everything.

00:16:16.676 --> 00:16:19.668
--Madam...
--Yes...

00:16:41.734 --> 00:16:44.513
How long've they been at it?

00:16:44.537 --> 00:16:49.518
Baki's toying with
Hanayama-san and Yuri...!

00:16:49.542 --> 00:16:52.955
Maybe I should give up
being a hoodlum...

00:16:52.979 --> 00:16:55.958
He's quite a kid, he is...

00:16:55.982 --> 00:17:00.162
--Should we give 'em a hand?
--Nah, we wouldn't stand a chance.

00:17:00.186 --> 00:17:05.386
Yeah. The gods of death on the
battlefield can't fight like that.

00:17:11.097 --> 00:17:13.566
Impossible...!

00:17:23.976 --> 00:17:26.775
Baki! Ten minutes to go!

00:17:28.614 --> 00:17:32.294
The kid really warmed up
for 12 hours straight...!

00:17:32.318 --> 00:17:34.753
What kind of stamina does he got?!

00:17:38.591 --> 00:17:39.568
What's that?

00:17:39.592 --> 00:17:43.105
Diving weights. 20 kilograms.

00:17:43.129 --> 00:17:47.464
--He fought us with that on...?
--He's one heck of a fighter...!

00:17:48.401 --> 00:17:50.836
Hey! Baki!

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.300
Ando-san! Kurokawa-san!

00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:01.657
What are you two doing here?

00:18:01.681 --> 00:18:04.393
Rushed here the minute we heard.

00:18:04.417 --> 00:18:08.263
This is a helluva mess.
Don't go dyin' now.

00:18:08.287 --> 00:18:09.364
I won't!

00:18:09.388 --> 00:18:11.867
Baki-kun. I wish you luck in battle.

00:18:11.891 --> 00:18:12.801
Thanks!

00:18:12.825 --> 00:18:16.159
WE'VE been here this whole time.

00:18:17.997 --> 00:18:21.610
Sanada-san, Kuraishi-san, and Chiba-san!
What're you doing here?

00:18:21.634 --> 00:18:28.836
Mister Kuriyagawa asked me to
contact everyone involved with you.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:34.222
Thanks, guys...!

00:18:34.246 --> 00:18:37.926
--Beat your old man!
--Yeah!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:40.095
Huh? Where's Nomura-san?

00:18:40.119 --> 00:18:45.216
He had some stuff to attend to.
Should be here soon.

00:18:49.895 --> 00:18:51.590
Here he is!

00:19:19.692 --> 00:19:22.404
Gaia...!

00:19:22.428 --> 00:19:26.729
--Why is Gaia--
--Don't tell me he--

00:19:27.566 --> 00:19:29.557
Gaia-san...!

00:19:47.386 --> 00:19:51.323
It's the Ogre... Hanma Yujiro!

00:19:53.526 --> 00:19:56.325
His fighting spirit
is like a tempest...

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:06.202
Mom!

00:20:08.507 --> 00:20:13.388
A cruel sight. A battle between
father and son is about to unfold,

00:20:13.412 --> 00:20:16.211
and mother stands by father...

00:20:22.788 --> 00:20:25.300
What's the matter, Baki?

00:20:25.324 --> 00:20:27.418
It's time!

00:20:32.665 --> 00:20:34.394
That's the look!

00:20:45.377 --> 00:20:47.823
--What the...2?!
--An earthquake!

00:20:47.847 --> 00:20:49.224
A big one!

00:20:49.248 --> 00:20:51.945
Now, of all times!

00:21:09.869 --> 00:21:12.861
It stopped...!

00:21:17.076 --> 00:21:19.636
No worries now...

00:21:20.579 --> 00:21:23.358
He stopped it?! No way...!

00:21:23.382 --> 00:21:25.894
He stopped an earthquake
with his fist?!

00:21:25.918 --> 00:21:30.265
Was that the power that defeated Gaia,
god of the earth?

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:32.667
What tenacious self-confidence...

00:21:32.691 --> 00:21:35.203
Is even the earth's anger powerless

00:21:35.227 --> 00:21:38.390
before the Ogre's confidence
as world's strongest?

00:21:39.331 --> 00:21:43.427
S-so what?!

00:21:51.277 --> 00:21:54.890
--He's got him in a naked choke!
--There's no escaping that!

00:21:54.914 --> 00:21:57.859
He can win! He can win, Madam!

00:21:57.883 --> 00:22:00.750
That almost looks like--

00:22:04.957 --> 00:22:08.416
--A father carrying
his son on his back...

00:22:46.198 --> 00:22:51.746
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:57.352
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:57.376 --> 00:23:03.024
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:08.029
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:08.053 --> 00:23:13.568
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:13.592 --> 00:23:19.107
gently enveloped in love

00:23:19.131 --> 00:23:24.779
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:24.803 --> 00:23:30.318
but they will be reborn

00:23:30.342 --> 00:23:35.991
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:36.015 --> 00:23:42.682
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:51.497 --> 00:23:53.363
"Next Episode”

00:23:57.469 --> 00:24:01.349
A passionate,
long-held dream of the boy...

00:24:01.373 --> 00:24:03.184
Of the mother...

00:24:03.208 --> 00:24:05.420
Of the men...

00:24:05.444 --> 00:24:09.291
"You all raised him," the father says.

00:24:09.315 --> 00:24:13.561
At the threshold of ferocious passion,
one feeling is awakened,

00:24:13.585 --> 00:24:16.364
becomes everlasting,
and melts into the night.

00:24:16.388 --> 00:24:21.326
"Next Episode: After the Dream”
